      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = 3 x^{3} + 5 x + 3 \\). Find the value of c in the open interval \\( (0, 3) \\) at which the instantaneous rate of change of f equals the average rate of change of f over \\( \\left[0, 3\\right] \\). Give the exact value.",
